WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.272
Today is the final check. It takes about four minutes.

2
00:00:03.722 --> 00:00:07.112
Your child uses their page. You have the grown-up page.

3
00:00:07.562 --> 00:00:14.170
It has three parts. Words with a silent e. Words with two vowels together. And two new sentences.

4
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:15.743
Do not help today.

5
00:00:16.443 --> 00:00:20.153
Your child has never seen these words. So memory cannot help.

6
00:00:20.603 --> 00:00:25.032
Write the three numbers on your page. Then put it beside the page from day one.

7
00:00:25.482 --> 00:00:29.680
Your page tells you what the result means, and exactly what to do next.

8
00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:35.275
If it is not there yet, that is a result too. The page tells you which days to do again.

9
00:00:35.725 --> 00:00:40.393
Then scan the code at the top for the report. And let your child color the last star.
